+              <span data-wui-i18n-html="docs_kanban_36">The Task Board demo color-codes accents to priority (<code>warning</code>/<code>danger</code>/<code>primary</code>/<code>secondary</code>) and deliberately leaves two cards without one. The different-column-set demo uses tier accents (<code>tier-1</code>/<code>tier-2</code>/<code>tier-4</code>) instead, keyed to work-stream rather than priority — the same option, read however a board finds meaningful.</span>
+            </div>
