+          <p class="docs-desc" data-wui-i18n-html="docs_kanban_18">Mirrors <code>TaskManagement</code>'s real 4-status shape. Drag any card between columns. Dropping onto <strong>Rejected</strong> asks for confirmation first — Cancel snaps the card back to its origin column; Confirm commits the move. Watch the log line below the board.</p>
