+          <p class="docs-desc" data-wui-i18n-html="docs_kanban_23">On drop, <code>wui-kanban.js</code> moves the card's DOM node into the target column FIRST (mirroring the reference board's own "move visually first, cancel reverts" approach), THEN calls <code>opts.onBeforeMove</code>. If the result — or the value a returned <code>Promise</code> resolves to — is exactly <code>false</code>, the card animates back to its original position in its original column and gets a brief rejection cue. Anything else commits the move.</p>
