+                <td>That card is silently omitted from render (board keeps working); <code>console.warn</code> names the bad card id.</td>
+              </tr>
+              <tr>
+                <td><code>opts.onBeforeMove</code> omitted</td>
+                <td>Treated as always-<code>true</code> — every drop commits unconditionally. A board that doesn't need a confirmation step isn't forced to pass a trivial callback.</td>
+              </tr>
+            </tbody>
+          </table>
+        </div>
